{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"Updated [gen.py](/tmp/h-gCHRel/gen.py) to emit HR corridors with `start`/`end`, include an Intervals workout description with `hr=1s`, and select HR as the workout target. [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-gCHRel/ANSWER.md) explains the change and the watch readback.\n\nI checked the generated sample locally. I did not send it to Intervals.icu, so the watch display remains unverified."}}
